' The product NAME is never in this table: the Share Manager's name goes through a {0} placeholder (ProductNames.ShareManager).
' A server-side reason is never shown raw - each refusal has one sentence here, and an unknown reason has the generic one.
' House style: ".." for an ellipsis, a plain hyphen, ё in Russian. Words that already exist in the Share Manager's tables
